cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use openOM, please cite it as below."
title: openOM
abstract: >-
  An open (MIT) standard and toolchain that embeds machine-readable, broker-asserted,
  hash-verified data inside commercial real estate offering-memorandum PDFs, and mirrors
  the same payload as JSON-LD on the web. Deterministic core, inference at the edges.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Vervelio Labs
    website: "https://verveliolabs.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sarthaknimbalkar/OpenOM"
url: "https://openom.app"
license: MIT
version: "0.1"
keywords:
  - commercial real estate
  - offering memorandum
  - JSON-LD
  - JSON Schema
  - open standard
  - proptech
